sf-design

This skill folder, and four agent files in ../../agents/, contain material derived from
two third-party works. The files were modified: content was rewritten, merged with this
skill's existing text, reorganised into new files and modes, tied to an optional external
tool instead of a bundled one, and, for the vendored scripts, changed to keep every write
inside the project (draw history and the browser profile moved into `.design/`, working
folder renamed, identifying strings changed).

